  "score": null,
  "definition": "Plasmate, in PKD's exegesis, is the living information — the maze, the Grail — fired to us from outside by Valis / Logos / Christ (CLM_S_ec9f17a68f). PKD groups it with \"Christ, the Logos, invading, Valis, transubstantiation\" as approximate names for a 3-eyed reality reached only with 2-eyed concepts (CLM_S_6bd774c0eb).",
  "interpretive_note": "The plasmate occupies a strategic place in PKD's vocabulary: it is one of the names (\"Christ, the Logos, invading, the plasmate, Valis, transubstantiation\") for the same intervening reality, and PKD acknowledges these are all 2-eyed terms approximating a 3-eyed thing (CLM_S_6bd774c0eb). In 3-74 he saw the cosmic Christ as Valis and the plasmate and communed with it: it \"informed him\" (CLM_S_e47998bcfd). The \"maze, Grail, plasmate, living information\" are minds and instructions fired to us from outside (CLM_S_ec9f17a68f).",
  "visionary_significance": null,
  "scholarly_caution": null,
  "card_description": "A living informational entity that can bond with a human to create a homoplasmate, a hybrid of biology and divine information.",
  "full_description": "A living informational entity that can bond with a human to create a homoplasmate, a hybrid of biology and divine information.\n\n**Category:** PKD Visionary\n\n**Key segment contexts:**\n- (September 15, 1976) Dick develops the \"Scramble Generator\" model: the \"Black Iron Prison\" (BIP) is a machine (Yahweh/Demiurge) that scrambles our perceptions. He argues that Christ/OCCP is a \"telos seed\" (explosive) s...\n- (September 15, 1976) Dick formulaizes a law of \"Cosmic Justice\" (Ma'at/Tao): when an oppressor (B) \"oversteps\" its limit against an innocent victim (C), it triggers a \"justification\" by Valis that confers divinity (Apo...\n- (September 15, 1976) Dick concludes that 3-74 was the planting of a \"Micro-Cosmos Seed\" (Thomas/Telos) within him to replace the \"Scramble World\" of the Empire. He views his writing and experiences as \"world-creation,\"...",
